0:03:40.00 --> 0:04:30.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: A deer is killed by some native Americans.)

0:18:15.00 --> 0:21:00.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A British convoy is ambushed by a Native tribe. They fire at each other causing many casualties. The Natives throw battle axes and kill many solidiers. In one brief scene a dead British soldier is scalped.)

0:24:53.51 --> 0:24:54.07
profane word 1 (damn)

0:25:15.00 --> 0:25:40.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: We see a dead woman lying in blood.)

0:35:25.00 --> 0:39:40.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: A British fort is attacked. The fort is repeatedly hit by cannon fire - causing some casualties.)

0:48:10.00 --> 0:48:45.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A man is shot and killed.)

0:54:03.68 --> 0:54:04.48
profane word 1 (hell / damn)

0:56:10.00 --> 0:57:40.00
sex 2 (SceneRadar: A couple make out. Sex is implied.)

1:02:05.00 --> 1:03:00.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: Battle sequence with lots of canon fire. Some casualties.)

1:07:49.17 --> 1:07:49.77
profane word 1 (hell)

1:13:10.00 --> 1:22:00.00
violence 3 (SceneRadar: A British convoy is ambused by Natives. The two sides use guns, battle axes and daggers. Many casualties. A man's throat is slit. The captain is killed and his heart is carved out. We see the bloodied heart in the attackers hands. Later the survivors escape via boat.)

1:39:00.00 --> 1:39:30.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A man is tied to a pole and tortured with fire. He is shot dead later.)

1:41:10.00 --> 1:46:15.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A party is ambushed while making their way through a mountain pass. The attacker is stabbed, his stomach slashed and later pushed down a cliff to his death. A girl from the party also moves to the edge of the cliff and jumps off. The victim's brother arrives - and in a fit of rage shoots, stabs his arms and shoulders and finally kills the man.)
